<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) has issued 25 million American-style call warrants, on the MIB-30 index, lead manager Morgan Stanley International said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    18000		     PREMIUM	22.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     340 LIRE		  GEARING	44.1 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.NOV.96-19.SEP.97   PAYDATE	22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  15000</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
